{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/less/less.js/issues/2421","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/less/less.js","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/less/less.js/issues/2421/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/less/less.js/issues/2421/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/less/less.js/issues/2421/events","html_url":"https://github.com/less/less.js/issues/2421","id":55849281,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWU1NTg0OTI4MQ==","number":2421,"title":"!important tag changing mixin with nested checks","user":{"login":"leigeber","id":255097,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1NTA5Nw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/255097?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/leigeber","html_url":"https://github.com/leigeber","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leigeber/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leigeber/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leigeber/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leigeber/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leigeber/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leigeber/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leigeber/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leigeber/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leigeber/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":2103265,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMTAzMjY1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/less/less.js/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"e10c02","default":true,"description":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":10,"created_at":"2015-01-29T02:51:29Z","updated_at":"2015-02-01T15:06:44Z","closed_at":"2015-02-01T15:06:44Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"So this issue is a little obscure but it bit us today when using !important with one of our more complex mixins. Below is a stripped down example:\n\n``` less\n.testMixin () {\n    .topCheck () {\n        .nestedCheck() {\n            margin: 5px;\n        }\n        .nestedCheck();\n    }\n    .topCheck();\n}\n.class1 {\n    .testMixin() !important;\n}\n.class2 {\n    .testMixin();\n}\n```\n\nThis outputs the following:\n\n``` css\n.class1 {margin: 5px !important}\n.class2 {margin: 5px !important}\n```\n\nThe issue being here that adding !important to the first mixin call permanently attaches it to any subsequent calls. It only appears to be present when there are 2 levels of nested functions inside the outer mixin. We are using Less 2.3.1.\n","closed_by":{"login":"SomMeri","id":618879,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxODg3OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/618879?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SomMeri","html_url":"https://github.com/SomMeri","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SomMeri/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SomMeri/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SomMeri/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SomMeri/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SomMeri/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SomMeri/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SomMeri/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SomMeri/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SomMeri/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/less/less.js/issues/2421/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api